[
  {
    "id": "2a9bf85c-f975-4054-9597-5f4f11414983",
    "name": "伊洛薇恩",
    "dossierSubtitle": "「秩序」与「公义」的织者",
    "title": "吾之所言即为正义",
    "image": "/character-profile/redraws/elowen-v6-neckline.webp",
    "emblem": "/character-profile/elowen-order-justice-v2.svg",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "pp1x4vtez",
        "type": "key-value",
        "content": "",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "姓名",
        "value": "&nbsp; 伊洛薇恩 · 梅尔维尔 · 斯图亚特",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "4gb6ewqev",
        "type": "key-value",
        "content": "",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "势力",
        "value": "「第三意见」律师事务所 / <font color=\"#d4b58e\"><b>奥兰尼亚非常规事务署</b></font>",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "翡兰珀的人们相信法律面前人人平等，只是有些人的座位，离天平更近一些。",
        "dropCap": true
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "直到伊洛薇恩·梅尔维尔·斯图亚特把他们请上法庭。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "她是一位不太懂得体谅的律师。不体谅贵族的声誉、商人的难处，也不体谅某些不便公开的政府事务。委托人受了什么委屈，她便要对方一项一项地回答。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "有人劝她，世上的事不能全凭道理。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "她记住了这句话。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "所谓「秩序」，不是写在法典里的条文，也不是高悬于王座之上的天平，而是最古老的自然规则。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "规则被打破后，必然有人来修补。",
        "dropCap": false
      }
    ],
    "avatar": "/character-profile/redraws/elowen-v6-neckline-avatar.webp"
  },
  {
    "id": "bf217625-407b-4cff-ae92-4f1ba3ba8cca",
    "name": "希尔维娅",
    "title": "不凋的蓝翎",
    "image": "/character-profile/redraws/sylvia-v1.webp",
    "emblem": "/character-profile/sylvia-war-conquest.svg",
    "dossierSubtitle": "「征服」的织者",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "7xaxvly6o",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "年幼的雌狮诞生于战争之中。",
        "dropCap": true
      },
      {
        "id": "dq0kjvxek",
        "type": "key-value",
        "content": "",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "名字",
        "value": "希尔维娅 · 冯 · 艾森巴赫",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "6xfz42mdi",
        "type": "key-value",
        "content": "",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "势力",
        "value": "「逐猎之狮」骑士团",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "grloldpha",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "当第一声啼哭被隆隆的战鼓声淹没，希尔维娅的命运便已与锋刃交织。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "b65pjjtlx",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "她是<font color=\"#d4b58e\"><b>「征服」</b></font>的后裔，血统纯正且高贵。依<font color=\"#d4b58e\"><b>「纷争」康斯坦丁</b></font>的谕告，希尔维娅获赐<font color=\"#d4b58e\"><b>「征服」</b></font>的权柄，自此以剑锋拓展家族的疆界。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "94f5jewth",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "对她而言，战争不是灾难，而是神圣的职责。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "vstyuab3z",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "“我是骑士团的剑，亦是<font color=\"#d4b58e\"><b>「征服」</b></font>行走于世间的意志。我将踏平一切混乱，直至世界归于帝国的荣光。”",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "sfjt12zxq",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "年轻的蓝翎骑士永远在<font color=\"#d4b58e\"><b>「征服」</b></font>的路上。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      }
    ],
    "avatar": "/character-profile/redraws/sylvia-v1-avatar.webp"
  },
  {
    "id": "4ea0b64e-1c59-43a5-a082-caf6c6a5a790",
    "name": "尤菲米娅",
    "dossierSubtitle": "「记忆」的织者",
    "title": "咏唱繁花颂歌",
    "image": "/character-profile/redraws/euphemia-v1.webp",
    "emblem": "/character-profile/euphemia-memory.svg",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "ozy456cmh",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "在███的教会体系中，「不凋花庭」是一个特殊的存在——它既是修道院，也是圣所，更是那些虔诚纯净信徒的聚居之地。",
        "dropCap": true
      },
      {
        "id": "z4mhwnsft",
        "type": "key-value",
        "content": "",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "名字",
        "value": "&nbsp; 尤菲米娅 · 圣 · 克莱尔",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "2mp7a87ei",
        "type": "key-value",
        "content": "",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "势力",
        "value": "「不凋花庭」",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "kajob4j8v",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "尤菲米娅很年轻，看起来不过二十出头，温和、安静，说话轻声细语。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "qdv9s1hrw",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "她喜欢在花庭中散步，喜欢抚摸那些永不凋谢的花瓣，喜欢对前来朝圣的信徒微笑。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "ut3cgdjrn",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "只是，没有人记得她是什么时候来的……",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "nd0cmtfgl",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "她好像，一直都在。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "rvsavr7d7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "“或许，只是你们记错了。<font color=\"#d4b58e\"><b>毕竟记忆……都会模糊。</b></font>”",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "omgafr4il",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "庭中的花静静开着，谁也没有再追问。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "luro4b150",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "因为在「不凋花庭」，这个答案已足够好了。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      }
    ],
    "avatar": "/character-profile/redraws/euphemia-v1-avatar.webp"
  },
  {
    "id": "5bf8f6ab-da96-4cc6-a715-45050f289dd5",
    "name": "汐安娜",
    "dossierSubtitle": "「潮汐」的织者",
    "title": "溯梦的潮音",
    "image": "/character-profile/redraws/xianna-v1.webp",
    "emblem": "/character-profile/xianna-tides.svg",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "slgcetnvc",
        "type": "key-value",
        "content": "",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "全名",
        "value": "&nbsp;汐安娜",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "9z42dt5o7",
        "type": "key-value",
        "content": "",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "势力",
        "value": "&nbsp;无",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "潮水退去时，岸上多了一位少女。",
        "dropCap": true
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "她的记忆从一片潮湿的沙滩开始。太阳正在升起，海面泛着碎金般的光，海浪一遍遍舔舐着她的脚踝，然后退去，留下白色的泡沫和细碎的贝壳。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "人们问她从哪里来，她回头望向大海。问她要去哪里，她也答不上来。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "只有「潮汐」仍在呼唤她。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "每逢涨潮，那声音便清晰一些，仿佛有人在很远的地方，念着一个她本该熟悉的名字。她循声走去，穿过陌生的海岸，走向更远的地方。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "有人告诉她，前面已经没有路了。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "她站了一会儿，听见潮声从远处传来。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "于是，她继续向前。",
        "dropCap": false
      }
    ],
    "avatar": "/character-profile/redraws/xianna-v1-avatar.webp"
  },
  {
    "id": "ec561630-2810-41a0-8524-857bfa8365e1",
    "name": "第十四天",
    "dossierSubtitle": "「██」的织者",
    "title": "原世界防卫协议",
    "image": "/character-profile/redraws/day-fourteen-v1.webp",
    "emblem": "/character-profile/day-fourteen-tower.svg",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "kpe9hkgnc",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "██神话中，██有十三位。",
        "dropCap": true
      },
      {
        "id": "m652nyhsg",
        "type": "key-value",
        "content": "",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "名字",
        "value": "&nbsp;第十四天",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "xzr9umgj1",
        "type": "key-value",
        "content": "",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "势力",
        "value": "&nbsp;巴别塔生物科技有限公司 / 示拿地防卫军",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "ngnho7oej",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "巴别塔生物科技在经历了数十次失败之后，创造出了第十四位██。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "utyxkakq4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "他们叫她 <font color=\"#d4b58e\"><b>DAY 14</b></font>，最终的██诞生于第十四天。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "pn9vi7rbg",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "大远行来临前，巴别塔将她封存于████的最深处。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "ol8mtbxui",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "她在黑暗中等待了漫长的岁月，等待那一群人到来。",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "id": "xqfgz0zmc",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "“你们的到来，已被记录。”",
        "url": "",
        "caption": "",
        "key": "",
        "value": "",
        "scale": 100,
        "author": "",
        "dropCap": false
      }
    ],
    "avatar": "/character-profile/redraws/day-fourteen-v1-avatar.webp"
  },
  {
    "id": "f967a2c8-252b-4a1e-8e55-9ac5fe1597e2",
    "name": "伊莎贝拉",
    "title": "纯美的鸢尾花公主",
    "dossierSubtitle": "「无瑕」的织者",
    "image": "/character-profile/redraws/isabella-reference-v1.webp",
    "avatar": "/character-profile/redraws/isabella-reference-v1-avatar.webp",
    "emblem": "/character-profile/isabella-emblem.svg",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "key-value",
        "key": "姓名",
        "value": "伊莎贝拉·洛丽华·爱芮丝"
      },
      {
        "type": "key-value",
        "key": "势力",
        "value": "「不休旋舞」剧场 / <b>奥兰尼亚非常规事务署</b>"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "从前，奥兰尼亚有一位公主，想找到世上最美的东西。",
        "dropCap": true
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "花匠献上玫瑰，珠宝匠捧来宝石。可玫瑰会凋谢，宝石藏着裂纹，连窗外的月亮，也总有残缺的时候。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "于是，公主穿上舞鞋，走进了「不休旋舞」剧场。她想亲手创造一样「无瑕」的事物。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "后来，伊莎贝拉成为帝国最受欢迎的舞者。每当她踮起足尖，人们便忘记了花期、裂纹，以及月亮阴晴不定的脸。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "他们说，公主已经找到了。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "可最后一个音符落下时，她仍会望向台边的玫瑰。",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "“请再奏一次。”",
        "dropCap": false
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "她想知道，是否有一支舞，能让凋谢来不及发生。",
        "dropCap": false
      }
    ]
  }
]
